IMPORTANT: This is a placeholder certificate file.
For development: Generate a self-signed certificate using:
  openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -keyout ssl/indicab.key -out ssl/indicab.crt -days 365 -nodes

For production: Replace with Let's Encrypt certificate from:
  /etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/fullchain.pem

See SSL_SETUP_GUIDE.md for complete instructions.
